いかいで きんメダルを 四つ とりました。ディナ・アシャー・スミスさんは メダルを 十一こ とりました。", "キーリー・ホジキンソンさんも かつやくしました。３月の たいかいで ８００メートルに かちました。夏には イギリスの きろくを つくりました。", "ハンター・ベルさんは いいました。「みんなで いっしょに います。とても たのしいです。だれかが かつと わたしも がんばりたくなります」", "かのじょたちは ネイルや ふくを たのしみます。きれいに なると しあいに かつ ちからが 出ると いいます。", "ホジキンソンさんは あたらしい ふくで はしりました。ハンター・ベルさんは 「とても はやいと ききました。わたしも きてみたいです」と いいました。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["亨特·贝尔是英国选手。她跑800米和1500米。今年她拿到了三枚金牌。真厉害。", "其他女子选手也很努力。艾米·亨特在欧洲锦标赛上拿了四枚金牌。迪娜·阿舍-史密斯拿了十一枚奖牌。", "基利·霍奇金森也很活跃。她在三月的比赛中赢了800米。夏天她创造了英国纪录。", "亨特·贝尔说：“大家在一起。非常开心。有人赢了，我也想更加努力。”", "她们喜欢美甲和服装。她们说变漂亮了，比赛时就能发挥出力量。", "霍奇金森穿着新服装跑步。亨特·贝尔说：“听说非常快。我也想穿穿看。”"], "body": "ハンター・ベルさんは イギリスの せんしゅです。８００メートルと １５００メートルを はしります。ことし きんメダルを 三つ とりました。すごいですね。\n\nほかの 女子も がんばっています。エイミー・ハントさんは ヨーロッパの たいかいで きんメダルを 四つ とりました。ディナ・アシャー・スミスさんは メダルを 十一こ とりました。\n\nキーリー・ホジキンソンさんも かつやくしました。３月の たいかいで ８００メートルに かちました。夏には イギリスの きろくを つくりました。\n\nハンター・ベルさんは いいました。「みんなで いっしょに います。とても たのしいです。だれかが かつと わたしも がんばりたくなります」\n\nかのじょたちは ネイルや ふくを たのしみます。きれいに なると しあいに かつ ちからが 出ると いいます。\n\nホジキンソンさんは あたらしい ふくで はしりました。ハンター・ベルさんは 「とても はやいと ききました。わたしも きてみたいです」と いいました。", "body_zh": "亨特·贝尔是英国选手。她跑800米和1500米。今年她拿到了三枚金牌。真厉害。\n\n其他女子选手也很努力。艾米·亨特在欧洲锦标赛上拿了四枚金牌。迪娜·阿舍-史密斯拿了十一枚奖牌。\n\n基利·霍奇金森也很活跃。她在三月的比赛中赢了800米。夏天她创造了英国纪录。\n\n亨特·贝尔说：“大家在一起。非常开心。有人赢了，我也想更加努力。”\n\n她们喜欢美甲和服装。她们说变漂亮了，比赛时就能发挥出力量。\n\n霍奇金森穿着新服装跑步。亨特·贝尔说：“听说非常快。我也想穿穿看。”", "text": "ハンター・ベルさんは イギリスの せんしゅです。８００メートルと １５００メートルを はしります。ことし きんメダルを 三つ とりました。すごいですね。 ほかの 女子も がんばっています。エイミー・ハントさんは ヨーロッパの たいかいで きんメダルを 四つ とりました。ディナ・アシャー・スミスさんは メダルを 十一こ とりました。 キーリー・ホジキンソンさんも かつやくしました。３月の たいかいで ８００メートルに かちました。夏には イギリスの きろくを つくりました。 ハンター・ベルさんは いいました。「みんなで いっしょに います。とても たのしいです。だれかが かつと わたしも がんばりたくなります」 かのじょたちは ネイルや ふくを たのしみます。きれいに なると しあいに かつ ちからが 出ると いいます。 ホジキンソンさんは あたらしい ふくで はしりました。ハンター・ベルさんは 「とても はやいと ききました。わたしも きてみたいです」と いいました。", "vocab": [{"word": "せんしゅ", "pos": "noun", "zh": "选手", "note": "指运动员"}, {"word": "きんメダル", "pos": "noun", "zh": "金牌", "note": "比赛第一名获得的奖牌"}, {"word": "かつやく", "pos": "noun", "zh": "活跃、大显身手", "note": "常与する一起用"}, {"word": "はしる", "pos": "verb", "zh": "跑", "note": "五段动词"}, {"word": "たいかい", "pos": "noun", "zh": "大会、比赛", "note": "体育赛事"}, {"word": "きろく", "pos": "noun", "zh": "纪录", "note": "常与つくる、やぶる搭配"}, {"word": "がんばる", "pos": "verb", "zh": "努力、加油", "note": "五段动词"}, {"word": "ふく", "pos": "noun", "zh": "衣服、服装", "note": "这里指运动服"}], "title_original": "Hunter Bell celebrates in Team GB's 'glam' female track success", "summary_original": "Georgia Hunter Bell has enjoyed quite the year, winning a hat-trick of gold medals at the World Indoor Championships, for England at the Commonwealth Games, and again for Team GB at the European Championships.", "body_original": "Exclusive\nGeorgia Hunter Bell: British 800m and 1500m runner celebrates team's female track success\nGeorgia Hunter Bell, Keely Hodgkinson, Amy Hunt and Dina Asher-Smith are standout members of a strong British female core delivering medals on the track; Hunter Bell: \"We're locked into everyone's goals... someone winning or bringing home a medal, it makes you even more keen to do well\"\nThursday 8 October 2026 17:10, UK\nGeorgia Hunter Bell has enjoyed quite the year, winning a hat-trick of gold medals at the World Indoor Championships, for England at the Commonwealth Games, and again for Team GB at the European Championships.\nBut British female track success in 2025 certainly didn't stop there. Sprinter Amy Hunt made headlines with a record four-gold display in the Europeans in Birmingham, while Dina Asher-Smith now tops the all-time medal table at the championships after winning her 11th, eight of which are gold.\nAmong other successes, Keely Hodgkinson claimed World Indoor gold in the 800m in March - in the second-fastest indoor time in history - and set a new British record at that distance in the summer, though she'd be pipped to gold at the Europeans after sitting out the Commonwealth Games due to muscle tightness.\nPlease use Chrome browser for a more accessible video player\nSky Sports on WhatsApp: Breaking news, videos and analysis\nDownload the Sky Sports app for expert analysis, best video & more\nLatest Sky Sports deals\nor\nstream with no contract on NOW\n\"It's really cool. just being part of this era. It's really fun,\" Hunter Bell told\nSky Sports\n.\n\"We all know each other very well. We all travel together, see each other a lot throughout the year, so it's fun to tune in and be like, 'Oh, Amy's racing tonight'.\n\"We're locked into everyone's goals and what they're trying to do. And when you're on a team together, someone winning or bringing home a medal, it makes you even more keen to do well because you want to contribute.\"\nPlease use Chrome browser for a more accessible video player\nIn addition to her statement performances on the track during her record-breaking Europeans, Hunt earned attention for her curated nail art that gave nod to landmarks within Birmingham, like the Bull Ring.\n\"Everyone knows I love a bit of glam and I love my nails,\" Hunt told the\nBBC\nat the time.\nHunter Bell says it's something the GB squad share, as feeling your best self on the start line can provide \"that extra one or two per cent\" to make you \"feel like you can do anything\".\n\"I enjoy the whole process of getting ready. We get ready like we're going to a club, we're quite glammed up,\" Hunter Bell said.\n\"We definitely put effort into it, for sure. We want to look nice.\n\"It's about doing whatever you need to feel confident on the start line - and I just think it makes you race better if you're feeling good about yourself.\n\"So much of that comes from the training and the lead up, of course. But it's that extra one or two per cent that makes you stand on the start line and feel like you can do anything, feel like you're a winner.\"\nIn terms of eye-catching track looks, Hodgkinson dominated the final race of her 2026 season by winning the 800m at Athlos in London last month as she debuted a new full-length, hooded speed suit.\nHodgkinson's outfit reminded people of Australian Cathy Freeman's which she won the women's 400m in at the 2000 Sydney Olympics, and it could be a feature for athletes at the next Olympics in Los Angeles in 2028.\nHunter Bell didn't rule out being one of them to don the suit.\n\"The first time you see it, it's like, 'Whoa! Haven't seen that before',\" she said. \"It will be interesting to see whether it becomes the norm.\n\"They do say it's quicker, so I'm definitely not ruling it out.\"\nAround Sky\nUpgrade to get all of Sky Sports, including 1500 live football matches this season\nNot got Sky? Get instant access to Sky Sports with no contract", "fetched_at": "2026-10-09T01:24:15.123300", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "ハンター", "s": 0.125, "e": 0.637, "sm": 125, "em": 637, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "・", "s": 0.637, "e": 0.9, "sm": 637, "em": 900, "cs": 4, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "ベル", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.137, "sm": 900, "em": 1137, "cs": 5, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "さん", "s": 1.15, "e": 1.375, "sm": 1150, "em": 1375, "cs": 7, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "は", "s": 1.387, "e": 1.587, "sm": 1387, "em": 1587, "cs": 9, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "イギリス", "s": 1.65, "e": 2.112, "sm": 1650, "em": 2112, "cs": 11, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "の", "s": 2.125, "e": 2.225, "sm": 2125, "em": 2225, "cs": 15, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "せんしゅ", "s": 2.237, "e": 2.625, "sm": 2237, "em": 2625, "cs": 17, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "です", "s": 2.638, "e": 3.013, "sm": 2637, "em": 3012, "cs": 21, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "。", "s": 3.013, "e": 3.9, "sm": 3012, "em": 3900, "cs": 23, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "８", "s": 3.9, "e": 4.037, "sm": 3900, "em": 4037, "cs": 24, "ce": 25, "si": 1}, {"i": 11, "w": "０", "s": 4.037, "e": 4.175, "sm": 4037, "em": 4175, "cs": 25, "ce": 26, "si": 1}, {"i": 12, "w": "０", "s": 4.175, "e": 4.312, "sm": 4175, "em": 4312, "cs": 26, "ce": 27, "si": 1}, {"i": 13, "w": "メートル", "s": 4.312, "e": 4.862, "sm": 4312, "em": 4862, "cs": 27, "ce